Description: RcmdrShiny implementation of the core EZR statistical workflow:
    data preparation, descriptive statistics, t and proportion tests,
    nonparametric tests, regression, survival analysis, diagnostic accuracy
    and graphics.  Derived from RcmdrPlugin.EZR 1.70.
